{"type":"text","timestamp":1791648752034,"sessionID":"ses_8d7c5c39c060b42d71c8","part":{"id":"prt_1269659d1001ktXMChjCztc8OL","sessionID":"ses_8d7c5c39c060b42d71c8","messageID":"msg_1269638b6001P481lmErNQSG5G","type":"text","text":"**Defect in `parser.py:2`:** `bool(value)` checks truthiness instead of parsing exact strings. Confirmed:\n- `\"false\"` incorrectly returns `True`.\n- Invalid inputs such as `\"yes\"`, `\"\"`, and `None` return booleans instead of raising `ValueError`.\n\n**Recommended fix:** Explicitly accept `\"true\"` → `True` and `\"false\"` → `False`; raise `ValueError` for everything else. Do not normalize case or whitespace.\n\n**Prevent recurrence:** Add parameterized regression tests covering both valid strings and invalid inputs—including case variants, surrounding whitespace, empty strings, and non-string values—and run them in CI as an automated guardrail.\n\nNo files were changed.","time":{"start":1791648750033,"end":1791648752034}}}
